    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile kwilang'hana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, a bise shitwigelile kwīdīlīla na būkalalwa būtaale ī mihayo īyo twayigwile, tūtizūselemiwa tūkīleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū gwalī na nguzu ū mhayo ūyo gūkahayiwa mu nzīla ya bamalaika, na būlī būbi nūūlū būshitiigwa wanukūlaga mheela mu būtūngīlīja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hū kūhaya a bise tūkūpīla ginehe, ūlū tūleka kūbūdīlīla būpīji būtaale gītī wenūbū? Ū boi būkandya būsomboolwa na Seeba ng'wenekīlī, hama ū kū bise būkaanīlwa na a babo bakang'wigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūnū ū Mulungu nang'hwe akūjaga oolecha būkaanīji bokwe mu kwīta shimanīkījo na mihayo mingī ya kūkumya na ya būdūla, na kūntūma Moyo Ng'wela mu kagabanhīje ka mbika ningī, gīt'ūmo atogelilwe we ng'wenekīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'wenhi wa būpīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī sī īyo tūkwīhayaga gīkī īkūbiza ho, atītūūlile ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo bamalaika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo alīho ūmò akaanīlile ng'wipandī ilebe alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū īkī a baana balī banhū ba mininga na mīlī, nū ng'wene akabiza na būsangī ū mu yenīyo, gīkī ū mu kūcha kwakwe adūle kūnyagaja ū Shetani, ūyo alī na būdūla bo lūfu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatungūle pye abo mu būlamu wabo bose balī mu būsese kūlwa kogoha icha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno atasolile nīmo gwa kūgunanha bamalaika, alīyo gwa kūgunanha būbyīle bo ng'wa Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene akabiza gīt'ūmo balī a baana ba ng'wawe mu mbika jose, gīkī abize Ngabīji Ntaale wa shigongo, ūyo alī nsanyiwa ū mu mihayo ya ng'wa Mulungu; abize shitambo kūlwa shibi sha banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei īkī akaluha aho akageng'wa, hū kūhaya adūgije kūbagunanha abo bakūgemagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
